# lib/json.warp's rules that run code at compile time, its whole program or a rule word of extensions/rules/rule_words.warp:
# the compiler keeps them, taken with the module's own (rewrites.warp module_rule_paths; decision library-zero-bake-plan 1b)
rewrite parse($input, $type) => $result where $type is type and $result = typed_json($input, $type, $program)
